 compile for `metal-spirv` backend but works for `llvm-cpu` on an m1 Mac:\n```mlir\nmodule @module {\n  func.func @main(%arg0: !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>, %arg1: !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>) -> !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32> attributes {torch.assume_strict_symbolic_shapes} {   \n    %int0 = torch.constant.int 0\n    %int5 = torch.constant.int 5\n    %int-3 = torch.constant.int -3\n    %int1 = torch.constant.int 1\n    %0 = torch.aten.slice.Tensor %arg1, %int0, %int5, %int-3, %int1 : !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>, !torch.int, !torch.int, !torch.int, !torch.int -> !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>\n\n    %1 = torch.aten.add.Tensor %arg0, %0, %int1 : !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>, !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>, !torch.int -> !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>\n    return %1 : !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>\n  }\n}\n```\n\nError:\n```\nexported.mlir:9:10: error: 'memref.collapse_shape' op expected collapsed type to be 'memref<?xf32, #gpu.address_space<workgroup>>' but found 'memref<?xf32, #hal.descriptor_type<storage_buffer>>'\n    %1 = torch.aten.add.Tensor %arg0, %0, %int1 : !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>, !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>, !torch.int -> !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>\n         ^\nexported.mlir:9:10: note: see current operation: %53 = \"memref.collapse_shape\"(%52) <{reassociation = [[0, 1]]}> : (memref<?x?xf32, #gpu.address_space<workgroup>>) -> memref<?xf32, #hal.descriptor_type<storage_buffer>>\nexported.mlir:9:10: error: failed to run translation of source executable to target executable for backend #hal.executable.target<\"metal-spirv\", \"metal-msl-fb\", {iree_codegen.target_info = #iree_gpu.target<arch = \"apple\", features = \"spirv:v1.3,cap:Shader\", wgp = <compute =  fp32|fp16|int64|int32|int16|int8, storage =  b64|b32|b16|b8, subgroup =  shuffle|arithmetic, dot =  dp4xi8toi32, subgroup_size_choices = [32], max_workgroup_sizes = [1024, 1024, 1024], max_thread_count_per_workgroup = 1024, max_workgroup_memory_bytes = 32768, max_workgroup_counts = [65535, 65535, 65535]>>}>\n    %1 = torch.aten.add.Tensor %arg0, %0, %int1 : !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>, !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>, !torch.int -> !torch.vtensor<[?,?],f32>\n         ^\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce your issue\n\n1. Save to mlir to `exported.mlir`\n2. `iree-compile --iree-hal-target-backends=metal-spirv exported.mlir -o out.vmfb`\n3. Get error\n4. Changing to `llvm-cpu` compiles\n\n\n### What component(s) does this issue relate to?\n\nCompiler\n\n### Version information\n\npip installed:\n```\n  IREE compiler version 3.10.0rc20260107 @ ae97779f59a81bc56f804927be57749bb22548fa\n  LLVM version 22.0.0git\n  Optimized build\n```\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_","closed_at":"2026-06-27T20:25:51Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48962821?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex-Vasile","id":48962821,"login":"Alex-Vasile","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTYyODIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Vasile","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/23540/comments","created_at":"2026-02-21T02:18:15Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/23540/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/23540","id":3971073495,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"tota